# Series resistor (P5u, docs/p5u-bw80-chips/BW80_CHIPS_DESIGN.md §4.3): U1's first inverter
# drives A; R1 (1k) joins A to B, the second inverter's input; R2 (47k) pulls B up. B reads A
# through R1 (1k beats 47k); with nothing on A, both read R2's 1.

part J1 POWER
part U1 74LS04
part R1 R value=1k
part R2 R value=47k

net VCC U1.1A R2.1
net A   U1.1Y R1.1
net B   R1.2 R2.2 U1.2A
net B_N U1.2Y
net GND U1.3A U1.4A U1.5A U1.6A
